<title>USA: Harveys Casino chairman to step down.</title>
<headline>Harveys Casino chairman to step down.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE TAHOE, Nev 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harveys Casino Resorts on Thursday said it had named Charles Scharer as chairman of the board of directors, replacing Thomas Yturbide, who decided to step down.</p>
<p>Scharer is the company's president and chief executive officer, it said.</p>
<p>The company said Yturbide will serve as a consultant after he leaves the company.</p>
<p>It did not give a reason for his decision to step down.</p>
</text>
